<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2979] Fix links in README </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2979</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The links to the zeppelin website under the sections &quot;Install binary package&quot; and &quot;Build from Source&quot; are broken.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Both link currently point to &lt;a href=&quot;http://zeppelin.apache.org/docs/snapshot/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://zeppelin.apache.org/docs/snapshot/&lt;/a&gt;... which doesn&apos;t exist. They should point to &lt;a href=&quot;http://zeppelin.apache.org/docs/latest/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://zeppelin.apache.org/docs/latest/&lt;/a&gt;... &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Additionally, all links to the zeppelin website should start with https and not http.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
